{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670907317923252490","title":"AI 模型加速优化算法工程师","description":"岗位职责\n1、负责大模型、多模态大模型、AIGC、自动驾驶、多媒体/ISP 等 AI 模型端侧加速优化算法的研发与探索；\n2、负责模型训练调优及压缩优化，包括但不限于量化、剪枝、蒸馏、稀疏化、小型化、NAS、推理加速等技术研发；\n3、与芯片团队协同开展算法-芯片联合设计与优化，提供面向自研芯片的模型加速解决方案；\n4、支持业务模型在自研芯片上的训练优化、部署交付及性能持续优化。","requirement":"岗位要求\n1、在大模型、AIGC、自动驾驶、多媒体/ISP、AI 芯片等方向上具有相关项目或实习经验；\n2、熟悉模型量化、剪枝、蒸馏、稀疏化、训练调优及性能优化等模型压缩与加速技术；\n3、熟练使用 PyTorch，熟悉 Transformer、Diffusion 等模型，掌握 TensorRT、ONNX Runtime、TVM 等至少一种部署或优化框架；\n4、有芯片算法联合优化、端侧 AI 部署或模型加速项目经验者优先；\n5、有大模型/AIGC/自动驾驶/多媒体 ISP 模型优化经验，或相关论文、专利、开源项目者优先。","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786022442247,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7467761476330340460","name":"算法类","en_name":"Algorithm","i18n_name":"算法类"},"job_id":"7670907317923088650","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_na